<name>Paris protests Sat 17 Oct (updated 10-17 15:20)</name>
<description>The march has left République despite tensions with police. Earlier: tear gas at République and on Rue du Faubourg-Saint-Denis, and about 100 arrests in Paris by 12:36. Authorised route: Boulevard Magenta, Barbès, Boulevard de Clichy to Place de Clichy. Bastille rally banned; 25 métro stations closed; gatherings banned in central Paris until 22:00. Unofficial map built from press reports; check the Préfecture de police and RATP before travelling.</description>
<Style id="confirmed"><LineStyle><color>ff2c36d4</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>702c36d4</color></PolyStyle></Style>
<Style id="likely"><LineStyle><color>ff1a73e8</color><width>2</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>701a73e8</color></PolyStyle></Style>
