<Folder><name>Confirmed and likely</name>
<Placemark><name>Rally at Place de la République, 14:00 (13:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 13:00–20:00<br><br>Sortiraparis (citing Le Parisien), Affiches Parisiennes (09:53) and Paris Rouge all report the Gilets Jaunes and union march leaving République at 14:00, which matches the Gilets Jaunes call (Aladom). Student and high-school groups also gather here. Police used tear gas at République around 12:38 with several hundred people already gathered (BFMTV, via Titres de presse), and groups heading here put up barricades from street barriers around 12:30 (Le Tribunal du Net). About 100 arrests in Paris by 12:36. Authorities expected 30,000 to 60,000 people in Paris (Anadolu). The march then started from here despite tensions with police (franceinfo live headline). Clashes and wild processions in Paris are also reported (Epoch Times FR headline), without locations I could read.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a> · <a href="https://www.titrespresse.com/25523422603/paris-manifestations-octobre">Titres de presse, BFMTV item: tear gas at République (17 Oct 12:38)</a> · <a href="https://www.franceinfo.fr/economie/greve/direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-lyceens-etudiants-gilets-jaunes-des-milliers-de-manifestants-attendus-dans-toute-la-france_8241022.html">franceinfo live, headlines: tear gas before the march; march leaves République despite tensions (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.epochtimes.fr/manifestations-du-17-octobre-des-affrontements-a-paris-la-mairie-de-marseille-investie-et-des-corteges-sauvages-3372149.html">Epoch Times FR, headline: clashes in Paris and wild processions (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://britbrief.co.uk/crime/violence/france-protests-tear-gas-fired-in-paris-as-600-rallies-planned.html">Brit Brief, tear gas and about 40 arrests in Paris (17 Oct, 10:43 UK time)</a> · <a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/10/17/world/live-news/france-protests-paris-intl">CNN live, dozens detained in Paris (17 Oct, headline)</a> · <a href="https://www.anews.com.tr/europe/2026/10/17/yellow-vest-protesters-rally-in-france-with-support-from-students-farmers">Anadolu Agency (17 Oct 14:46)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353967-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-la-manifestation-prevue-ce-samedi">Sortiraparis, route update (17 Oct 07:34)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353907-greve-du-17-octobre-2026-manif-gilets-jaunes-lyceens-transports-a-quoi-s-attendre-a-paris">Sortiraparis, what to expect (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestations-du-17-octobre-a-paris-parcours-metro-quartiers-interdits-341322.html">Affiches Parisiennes, routes and bans (17 Oct 09:53)</a> · <a href="https://parisrouge.fr/2026/10/16/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-un-parcours-de-manifestation-parisienne-finalement-autorise-entre-republique-et-place-de-clichy/">Paris Rouge, route authorised (16 Oct 22:37)</a> · <a href="https://www.aladom.fr/actualites/secteur-service/11364/manifestations-du-17-octobre-2026-ou-sont-prevus-les-rassemblements-a-paris-rennes-lille-grenoble-et-bordeaux/">Aladom, gathering calls (updated 16 Oct 10:56)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.366999,48.867599,0 2.366920,48.867069,0 2.366687,48.866560,0 2.366308,48.866091,0 2.365799,48.865680,0 2.365178,48.865343,0 2.364470,48.865092,0 2.363702,48.864938,0 2.362903,48.864886,0 2.362104,48.864938,0 2.361336,48.865092,0 2.360627,48.865343,0 2.360007,48.865680,0 2.359497,48.866091,0 2.359119,48.866560,0 2.358886,48.867069,0 2.358807,48.867599,0 2.358886,48.868128,0 2.359119,48.868637,0 2.359497,48.869106,0 2.360007,48.869517,0 2.360627,48.869855,0 2.361336,48.870105,0 2.362104,48.870260,0 2.362903,48.870312,0 2.363702,48.870260,0 2.364470,48.870105,0 2.365178,48.869855,0 2.365799,48.869517,0 2.366308,48.869106,0 2.366687,48.868637,0 2.366920,48.868128,0 2.366999,48.867599,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>March République → Place de Clichy (route authorised by the prefecture) (14:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 14:00–20:00<br><br>Reported route: from République at 14:00 up Boulevard Magenta, past Barbès-Rochechouart, Anvers and Pigalle along Boulevard de Clichy to Place de Clichy. Sortiraparis, Affiches Parisiennes (09:53) and Paris Rouge (16 Oct, evening) all report this route as the one the prefecture authorised after talks failed; the Barbès, Anvers, Pigalle and Blanche stations close from 12:00. A franceinfo live headline says the procession started from République despite tensions with police; I found no crowd figure or progress report along the route.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.franceinfo.fr/economie/greve/direct-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-lyceens-etudiants-gilets-jaunes-des-milliers-de-manifestants-attendus-dans-toute-la-france_8241022.html">franceinfo live, headlines: tear gas before the march; march leaves République despite tensions (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353967-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-la-manifestation-prevue-ce-samedi">Sortiraparis, route update (17 Oct 07:34)</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353907-greve-du-17-octobre-2026-manif-gilets-jaunes-lyceens-transports-a-quoi-s-attendre-a-paris">Sortiraparis, what to expect (17 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestations-du-17-octobre-a-paris-parcours-metro-quartiers-interdits-341322.html">Affiches Parisiennes, routes and bans (17 Oct 09:53)</a> · <a href="https://parisrouge.fr/2026/10/16/mobilisation-du-17-octobre-un-parcours-de-manifestation-parisienne-finalement-autorise-entre-republique-et-place-de-clichy/">Paris Rouge, route authorised (16 Oct 22:37)</a> · <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-le-cortege-341287.html">Affiches Parisiennes, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.326836,48.882199,0 2.325712,48.882704,0 2.325301,48.883157,0 2.325184,48.883681,0 2.325378,48.884195,0 2.325584,48.884423,0 2.326176,48.884778,0 2.326644,48.884939,0 2.327448,48.885026,0 2.328462,48.885598,0 2.329250,48.885761,0 2.330071,48.885704,0 2.332781,48.885076,0 2.337723,48.883608,0 2.338858,48.883416,0 2.346632,48.884895,0 2.349528,48.885221,0 2.349929,48.885214,0 2.350687,48.885047,0 2.351291,48.884700,0 2.351505,48.884475,0 2.351649,48.884227,0 2.351709,48.883790,0 2.357151,48.877734,0 2.358918,48.877477,0 2.359655,48.877149,0 2.359977,48.876894,0 2.360171,48.876643,0 2.360307,48.876090,0 2.360243,48.875811,0 2.359666,48.874923,0 2.364136,48.869932,0 2.364949,48.868881,0 2.365033,48.868620,0 2.364973,48.868114,0 2.365220,48.867556,0 2.365205,48.867290,0 2.364946,48.866790,0 2.364417,48.866393,0 2.364075,48.866253,0 2.363699,48.866160,0 2.362901,48.866128,0 2.362146,48.866300,0 2.360731,48.867127,0 2.360522,48.867349,0 2.360314,48.867853,0 2.360324,48.868115,0 2.360552,48.868588,0 2.360510,48.868664,0 2.355602,48.874150,0 2.355364,48.874606,0 2.355380,48.875080,0 2.354745,48.875309,0 2.354467,48.875490,0 2.353832,48.876119,0 2.348250,48.882336,0 2.347026,48.882168,0 2.345059,48.881774,0 2.344611,48.881614,0 2.343797,48.881530,0 2.341402,48.881062,0 2.340401,48.880640,0 2.339561,48.880551,0 2.336425,48.881031,0 2.331161,48.882577,0 2.329945,48.882858,0 2.328746,48.882284,0 2.328062,48.882114,0 2.327233,48.882115,0 2.326836,48.882199,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Police charge and tear gas on Rue du Faubourg-Saint-Denis (10th) (11:30–16:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 11:30–16:00<br><br>At 11:45 police charged a kettled group and used tear gas on Rue du Faubourg-Saint-Denis (Le Tribunal du Net, 13:01). A group of about 300 students, pupils and rail unionists was also reported forming in the 10th arrondissement, with clashes with police (L'Humanité, via Titres de presse). The exact spot was not given, so the circle is approximate.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a> · <a href="https://www.titrespresse.com/25523422603/paris-manifestations-octobre">Titres de presse, BFMTV item: tear gas at République (17 Oct 12:38)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.362193,48.876199,0 2.362093,48.875529,0 2.361798,48.874884,0 2.361319,48.874290,0 2.360673,48.873769,0 2.359887,48.873342,0 2.358990,48.873024,0 2.358017,48.872829,0 2.357005,48.872763,0 2.355993,48.872829,0 2.355020,48.873024,0 2.354123,48.873342,0 2.353337,48.873769,0 2.352692,48.874290,0 2.352212,48.874884,0 2.351917,48.875529,0 2.351817,48.876199,0 2.351917,48.876870,0 2.352212,48.877514,0 2.352692,48.878108,0 2.353337,48.878629,0 2.354123,48.879057,0 2.355020,48.879374,0 2.355993,48.879570,0 2.357005,48.879636,0 2.358017,48.879570,0 2.358990,48.879374,0 2.359887,48.879057,0 2.360673,48.878629,0 2.361319,48.878108,0 2.361798,48.877514,0 2.362093,48.876870,0 2.362193,48.876199,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Police checks at Gare Saint-Lazare forecourt (10:00–13:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>LIKELY</b> · Sat 17 Oct 10:00–13:30<br><br>Around 10:30 the BRAV-M police unit intervened at the Saint-Lazare forecourt to check protesters gathering, and officers asked passers-by for ID (Le Tribunal du Net, Dawn / AFP). A group of several dozen then moved off through the city. Train station surroundings are covered by the gathering ban.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a> · <a href="https://www.dawn.com/news/2037825/france-faces-day-of-cost-of-living-protests">Dawn / AFP, about 60 detained, ID checks at Saint-Lazare (17 Oct)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#likely</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.328608,48.876299,0 2.328550,48.875911,0 2.328379,48.875537,0 2.328102,48.875193,0 2.327728,48.874892,0 2.327273,48.874644,0 2.326754,48.874461,0 2.326191,48.874347,0 2.325605,48.874309,0 2.325019,48.874347,0 2.324455,48.874461,0 2.323936,48.874644,0 2.323481,48.874892,0 2.323107,48.875193,0 2.322830,48.875537,0 2.322659,48.875911,0 2.322601,48.876299,0 2.322659,48.876687,0 2.322830,48.877060,0 2.323107,48.877404,0 2.323481,48.877706,0 2.323936,48.877953,0 2.324455,48.878137,0 2.325019,48.878250,0 2.325605,48.878288,0 2.326191,48.878250,0 2.326754,48.878137,0 2.327273,48.877953,0 2.327728,48.877706,0 2.328102,48.877404,0 2.328379,48.877060,0 2.328550,48.876687,0 2.328608,48.876299,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>17 October 1961 memorial march from the Grand Rex (16:30–19:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>LIKELY</b> · Sat 17 Oct 16:30–19:00<br><br>March for the 65th anniversary of 17 October 1961 starts at the Rex cinema (2nd arr.) at 16:30. The exact route is not published; the line shown is the usual way to Pont Saint-Michel.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#likely</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.343000,48.854381,0 2.344492,48.855876,0 2.345746,48.857693,0 2.346182,48.857998,0 2.350739,48.866121,0 2.350783,48.866547,0 2.351069,48.866926,0 2.351310,48.867090,0 2.352006,48.868349,0 2.351444,48.868545,0 2.351022,48.868889,0 2.347286,48.869661,0 2.346712,48.869848,0 2.346477,48.869993,0 2.346157,48.870360,0 2.346073,48.870779,0 2.346238,48.871189,0 2.346626,48.871525,0 2.346887,48.871649,0 2.347492,48.871785,0 2.347813,48.871793,0 2.350206,48.871355,0 2.355130,48.870253,0 2.355632,48.869951,0 2.355905,48.869540,0 2.355904,48.869091,0 2.355763,48.868801,0 2.349236,48.857210,0 2.348864,48.856686,0 2.348483,48.856426,0 2.347348,48.854812,0 2.346141,48.853591,0 2.346202,48.853036,0 2.346109,48.852832,0 2.345755,48.852480,0 2.345224,48.852244,0 2.344916,48.852182,0 2.344277,48.852182,0 2.343448,48.852405,0 2.342914,48.852664,0 2.342580,48.853042,0 2.342498,48.853477,0 2.342680,48.853974,0 2.343000,48.854381,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Gathering at Pont Saint-Michel (18:00–20:30)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>CONFIRMED</b> · Sat 17 Oct 18:00–20:30<br><br>Commemoration gathering at 18:30 (5th/6th arr.).<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#confirmed</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.347599,48.853400,0 2.347541,48.853012,0 2.347370,48.852639,0 2.347092,48.852295,0 2.346719,48.851993,0 2.346264,48.851746,0 2.345744,48.851562,0 2.345181,48.851449,0 2.344595,48.851410,0 2.344009,48.851449,0 2.343446,48.851562,0 2.342926,48.851746,0 2.342471,48.851993,0 2.342098,48.852295,0 2.341820,48.852639,0 2.341649,48.853012,0 2.341592,48.853400,0 2.341649,48.853788,0 2.341820,48.854161,0 2.342098,48.854505,0 2.342471,48.854807,0 2.342926,48.855054,0 2.343446,48.855238,0 2.344009,48.855351,0 2.344595,48.855390,0 2.345181,48.855351,0 2.345744,48.855238,0 2.346264,48.855054,0 2.346719,48.854807,0 2.347092,48.854505,0 2.347370,48.854161,0 2.347541,48.853788,0 2.347599,48.853400,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Taxi protest at Porte Maillot (06:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>LIKELY</b> · Sat 17 Oct 06:00–20:00<br><br>About 2,000 taxis rolling from Porte Maillot towards Roissy-CDG since Thursday. Road traffic to the airports may be slow; RER B is the alternative.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/news/in-paris/articles/353907-strike-on-october-17-2026-yellow-vests-protests-by-high-school-students-transport-what-to-expect-in-paris">Sortiraparis transport guide, updated 16 Oct</a> · <a href="https://www.thelocal.fr/20261016/map-what-are-the-routes-for-saturdays-paris-protest">The Local, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#likely</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.288456,48.877999,0 2.288351,48.877293,0 2.288041,48.876615,0 2.287536,48.875989,0 2.286857,48.875441,0 2.286029,48.874991,0 2.285085,48.874657,0 2.284061,48.874451,0 2.282995,48.874381,0 2.281930,48.874451,0 2.280906,48.874657,0 2.279962,48.874991,0 2.279134,48.875441,0 2.278455,48.875989,0 2.277950,48.876615,0 2.277639,48.877293,0 2.277534,48.877999,0 2.277639,48.878705,0 2.277950,48.879383,0 2.278455,48.880009,0 2.279134,48.880557,0 2.279962,48.881007,0 2.280906,48.881341,0 2.281930,48.881547,0 2.282995,48.881616,0 2.284061,48.881547,0 2.285085,48.881341,0 2.286029,48.881007,0 2.286857,48.880557,0 2.287536,48.880009,0 2.288041,48.879383,0 2.288351,48.878705,0 2.288456,48.877999,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>Possible routes (not agreed)</name>
<Placemark><name>Student march République → Nation (not confirmed) (14:00–20:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>POSSIBLE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 14:00–20:00<br><br>Affiches Parisiennes (09:53) says the student and high-school march (Interfac) goes from République to Nation along Boulevard Voltaire, with no start time given. The prefecture offered this route after banning République to Concorde (Public Sénat, 15 Oct). Sortiraparis instead says Interfac follows the Clichy route, and Le Tribunal du Net (13:01) says the student procession was cancelled without saying which one, so treat this as unconfirmed.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://mesinfos.fr/75000-paris/manifestations-du-17-octobre-a-paris-parcours-metro-quartiers-interdits-341322.html">Affiches Parisiennes, routes and bans (17 Oct 09:53)</a> · <a href="https://www.publicsenat.fr/actualites/societe/17-octobre-le-mouvement-sorganise-peu-a-peu-entre-250-et-1000-actions-prevues-dans-toute-la-france">Public Sénat, 15 Oct</a> · <a href="https://www.sortiraparis.com/actualites/a-paris/articles/353967-mobilisation-du-17-octobre-a-paris-quel-parcours-pour-la-manifestation-prevue-ce-samedi">Sortiraparis, route update (17 Oct 07:34)</a> · <a href="https://www.letribunaldunet.fr/actualites/manifestation-17-octobre-incidents-avant-le-depart.html">Le Tribunal du Net, live blog with BFMTV items (17 Oct 13:01)</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#possible</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.365108,48.867895,0 2.365732,48.867830,0 2.366509,48.867492,0 2.372698,48.863794,0 2.373260,48.863234,0 2.374035,48.863013,0 2.396187,48.849806,0 2.396601,48.849439,0 2.396772,48.848994,0 2.396673,48.848540,0 2.396319,48.848146,0 2.395764,48.847871,0 2.395093,48.847758,0 2.394408,48.847824,0 2.393812,48.848059,0 2.379692,48.856478,0 2.379117,48.856611,0 2.378833,48.856744,0 2.378594,48.856912,0 2.378289,48.857313,0 2.372529,48.860744,0 2.371803,48.860757,0 2.371478,48.860821,0 2.370911,48.861065,0 2.370524,48.861432,0 2.370072,48.862200,0 2.364775,48.865361,0 2.363956,48.865502,0 2.362593,48.866221,0 2.361921,48.866641,0 2.361536,48.867022,0 2.361401,48.867472,0 2.361536,48.867922,0 2.361921,48.868303,0 2.362497,48.868558,0 2.363176,48.868648,0 2.363855,48.868558,0 2.364162,48.868450,0 2.365108,48.867895,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
