<Placemark><name>Gatherings banned: Châtelet, Les Halles, Hôtel de Ville (07:00–22:00)</name><description><![CDATA[<b>BANNED ROUTE</b> · Sat 17 Oct 07:00–22:00<br><br>Undeclared gatherings are banned at Place du Châtelet, the Les Halles area, the Hôtel de Ville, the Palais de Justice and the Préfecture de Police from 07:00 to 22:00. The exact perimeter was not published; the circle is an approximation.<br><br>Sources: <a href="https://fr.news.yahoo.com/sport/mobilisation-17-octobre-interdiction-manifester-205841271.html">Yahoo Actualités, banned sectors (night of 16 Oct)</a> · <a href="https://www.jeanmarcmorandini.com/article-655004-inquietude-pour-le-17-octobre-la-prefecture-interdit-ce-soir-de-manifester-dans-plusieurs-secteurs-de-paris-mais-surtout-autour-de-l-elysee-et-matignon-mais-aussi-la-place-de-la-concorde.html">Jean-Marc Morandini, banned sectors, 16 Oct</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#banned</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>2.353824,48.858401,0 2.353693,48.857519,0 2.353304,48.856671,0 2.352674,48.855889,0 2.351825,48.855204,0 2.350790,48.854641,0 2.349610,48.854224,0 2.348330,48.853966,0 2.346998,48.853879,0 2.345666,48.853966,0 2.344386,48.854224,0 2.343205,48.854641,0 2.342171,48.855204,0 2.341322,48.855889,0 2.340691,48.856671,0 2.340303,48.857519,0 2.340172,48.858401,0 2.340303,48.859283,0 2.340691,48.860132,0 2.341322,48.860913,0 2.342171,48.861599,0 2.343205,48.862161,0 2.344386,48.862579,0 2.345666,48.862836,0 2.346998,48.862923,0 2.348330,48.862836,0 2.349610,48.862579,0 2.350790,48.862161,0 2.351825,48.861599,0 2.352674,48.860913,0 2.353304,48.860132,0 2.353693,48.859283,0 2.353824,48.858401,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
